      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "i see one issue with this, the servers already has enough issues with keeping the servers bandwidth in check, and ontop of that the audio api is very ineffecient and the api is not that great and this would only add more to the server and client would have to decode and keep up with, being this would most likely would fall on the client side to keep up with which would be difficult",
