      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I like it, but I would still prefer a system that would allow voice calls regardless of the world you're in, it would solve a lot of issues for many users (especially if you could see another player's avatar/movement/gestures in a different world). That would be a great addition to the social experience in VRChat, absolutely.",
