  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-02-27T11:20:44.688Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Being able to select a user in the \"in-room\" list and \"voice call\" with them.\nThe user being called would see a phone notification icon and could accept the call. As long both users are in the world they can talk with each other over any distance. The phone call would sound 2D (non-spatialized and perhaps a vague sound filter?)\nThere can only be 2 users max per voice call to discourage groups of people being on voice instead of interacting with people around them. A phone speech bubble would appear on their nameplate when talking. They would not be able to hear or talk with other players around them, or maybe shorten the radius of the transmitting and receiving voices for the caller, so they would have some awareness to the players around them.",
